{"v":1,"book":"Ps","ch":1,"verses":[{"n":1,"text":"Blessed is the man Who does not walk In the counsel of the wicked, Nor stand on the path of sinners, Nor sit in the seat of mockers;","tok":[{"t":"Blessed","s":["H0835"],"a":[0]},{"t":" is the "},{"t":"man","s":["H0376"],"a":[1]},{"t":" Who does not "},{"t":"walk","s":["H1980"],"a":[4]},{"t":" In the "},{"t":"counsel","s":["H6098"],"a":[5]},{"t":" of the wicked, Nor "},{"t":"stand","s":["H5975"],"a":[10]},{"t":" on the "},{"t":"path","s":["H1870"],"a":[7]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"sinners","s":["H2400"],"a":[8]},{"t":", Nor sit in the "},{"t":"seat","s":["H4186"],"a":[11]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"mockers","s":["H3887"],"a":[12]},{"t":";"}]},{"n":2,"text":"Rather his delight is in the law of Jehovah, And in His law he meditates by day and by night.","tok":[{"t":"Rather his "},{"t":"delight","s":["H2656"],"a":[4]},{"t":" is in the "},{"t":"law","s":["H8451"],"a":[2]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[3]},{"t":", And in His "},{"t":"law","s":["H8451"],"a":[5]},{"t":" he "},{"t":"meditates","s":["H1897"],"a":[6]},{"t":" by "},{"t":"day","s":["H3119"],"a":[7]},{"t":" and by "},{"t":"night","s":["H3915"],"a":[8]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":3,"text":"And he will be like a tree Transplanted beside streams of water, Which yields its fruit in its season, And whose foliage does not wither; And everything he does prospers.","tok":[{"t":"And he will be like a "},{"t":"tree","s":["H6086"],"a":[1]},{"t":" Transplanted beside streams of "},{"t":"water","s":["H4325"],"a":[5]},{"t":", Which yields its "},{"t":"fruit","s":["H6529"],"a":[7]},{"t":" in its "},{"t":"season","s":["H6256"],"a":[9]},{"t":", And whose foliage does not "},{"t":"wither","s":["H5034"],"a":[12]},{"t":"; And everything he does "},{"t":"prospers","s":["H6743"],"a":[16]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":4,"text":"The wicked are not so, But are like chaff, Which the wind drives away.","tok":[{"t":"The wicked are not so, But are like "},{"t":"chaff","s":["H4671"],"a":[5]},{"t":", Which the "},{"t":"wind","s":["H7307"],"a":[8]},{"t":" drives "},{"t":"away","s":["H5086"],"a":[7]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":5,"text":"Therefore the wicked will not stand in the judgment; Nor the sinners, in the assembly of the righteous.","tok":[{"t":"Therefore the wicked will not "},{"t":"stand","s":["H6965"],"a":[3]},{"t":" in the "},{"t":"judgment","s":["H4941"],"a":[5]},{"t":"; Nor the "},{"t":"sinners","s":["H2400"],"a":[6]},{"t":", in the "},{"t":"assembly","s":["H5712"],"a":[7]},{"t":" of the "},{"t":"righteous","s":["H6662"],"a":[8]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":6,"text":"For Jehovah knows the way of the righteous, But the way of the wicked will perish.","tok":[{"t":"For "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[2]},{"t":" "},{"t":"knows","s":["H3045"],"a":[1]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"way","s":["H1870"],"a":[3]},{"t":" of the "},{"t":"righteous","s":["H6662"],"a":[4]},{"t":", But the "},{"t":"way","s":["H1870"],"a":[5]},{"t":" of the wicked will "},{"t":"perish","s":["H0006"],"a":[7]},{"t":"."}]}]}
